      "content": "i dont think it's psychological. it feels way too physical for that. last night i was sitting in the dark and i could literally feel the layout of the room just by the way the air was vibrating. its like my senses are leveling up or something. if this is some kind of biological activation, how do i handle it? like how do i manage the sensory overload so i can actually process what's happening without going crazy from the noise and the light?",
